          "settings": {
            "html": "<section class=\"bowls-section\">\n  <img class=\"bowls-img\" src=\"\" alt=\"Crystal sound bowls and Tibetan bowls arranged poolside\">\n  <div class=\"bowls-text\">\n    <h2>The sound comes<br><em>from the earth.</em><br>It returns to the body.</h2>\n    <p>Crystal bowls. Tibetan bowls. Soundscapes layered with intention. Each session is played live — not recorded, not repeated. The sound you hear that evening will never exist again exactly that way.</p>\n    <p>Komal has been facilitating immersive sound experiences since 2023, creating spaces where deep rest isn't something you have to try for — it simply arrives.</p>\n    <a href=\"#notify\" class=\"btn-p\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;display:inline-block\">I want to experience this</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n:root {\n  --stone:#0E1B30;--midnight:#1D3152;--seafoam:#688F9D;\n  --wave:#A4B2BA;--breeze:#D9E8EB;--sand:#C4BBB4;--cream:#F7F0EC;\n}\n\n.bowls-section {\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;\n  align-items: center !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  padding: 0 !important;\n  background: var(--stone) !important;\n}\n\n.bowls-img {\n  width: 100% !important;\n  height: 560px !important;\n  object-fit: cover !important;\n  object-position: center !important;\n}\n\n.bowls-text {\n  padding: 5rem !important;\n}\n\n.bowls-text h2 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem) !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  line-height: 1.2 !important;\n  color: var(--cream) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1.75rem !important;\n}\n\n.bowls-text h2 em {\n  font-style: italic !important;\n  color: var(--wave) !important;\n}\n\n.bowls-text p {\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.93rem !important;\n  line-height: 1.9 !important;\n  color: var(--wave) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1.25rem !important;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .bowls-section {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\n  }\n  .bowls-img {\n    height: 320px !important;\n  }\n  .bowls-text {\n    padding: 3rem 1.5rem !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
